  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/433/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"752\" height=\"221\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>为Alex的怪物与农夫乐事添加兼容性</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"color:#f00\">显然需要这些模组&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1.18及以下版本不再支持</span></em></p><p><span style=\"font-size:10px\">也来看看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-abnormalities\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex的异常生物</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/389/screenshot-2022-08-20-120945.png\" width=\"563\" height=\"212\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>当前物品：</strong></span></p><p>袋鼠肉块</p><p>驼鹿肋骨肉</p><p>野牛肉</p><p>野牛肉饼</p><p>菌菇兔肉</p><p>菌菇兔腿肉</p><p>鲶鱼片</p><p>袋鼠炖菜</p><p>驼鹿肋骨烤肉串配方</p><p>蛆虫沙拉</p><p>龙虾意面</p><p>金合欢花汤</p><p>贡吉莉迪亚面包片</p><p>野牛汉堡</p><p>菌菇兔肉三明治</p><p>袋鼠意面</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><em>如果新的袋鼠汉堡配方或野牛/菌菇兔的战利品表未生效，请禁用并重新启用Alex的美味数据包，然后再启用Alex的怪物数据包</em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#00f\">感谢超过2000万次下载！</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f0f\">如有问题、建议或想参与其中，请加入<a style=\"color:#f0f\" href=\"https://discord.gg/J33aMKf4SC\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord服务器！</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00\">欢迎推荐功能特性</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">你可以将此模组用于任何整合包或视频中。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">通过使用<span style=\"color:#00f\"> <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d107\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接</a>&nbsp;</span>购买首月可享受15%折扣！请务必在结账时输入优惠码</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><img style=\"displ